@page
@model peeposredemption.API.Pages.IndexModel
@{
    Layout = "_LandingLayout";
    ViewData["Title"] = "Torvex — IT Solutions & Custom Software";
    ViewData["OgTitle"] = "Torvex — IT Solutions & Custom Software";
    ViewData["Description"] = "IT support, networking, security, and custom software for small businesses. Straight answers, fair pricing, and work done by the person you actually talk to.";
}

<section class="hero">
    <h1>Technology problems, <span class="hero-accent">handled.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-emotional">IT support and custom software for small businesses.</p>
    <p>Networks, security, and the systems your business runs on — taken care of by the person who actually does the work.</p>
    <div class="hero-micro">Straight answers. Fair pricing. No call centers.</div>
    <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="/Packages" class="btn-large btn-signup">Packages &amp; pricing</a>
        <a href="/Contact" class="btn-large btn-login">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="features" id="services">
    <h2>What Torvex can do for you</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">If it plugs in, connects, or runs code — it's covered.</p>
    <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
            <span class="feature-icon">🖥️</span>
            <h3>IT support &amp; troubleshooting</h3>
            <p>Computers, email, printers, software — when something breaks, it gets fixed, and you learn what happened.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <span class="feature-icon">🌐</span>
            <h3>Networks &amp; Wi-Fi</h3>
            <p>Office networks, Wi-Fi that reaches where it should, VPNs, and remote access set up properly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <span class="feature-icon">🔐</span>
            <h3>Security &amp; backups</h3>
            <p>Account security, hardening, backup plans that actually restore — and cleanup when something bad happens.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <span class="feature-icon">⚙️</span>
            <h3>Automation &amp; integrations</h3>
            <p>Connect the tools you already use and automate the busywork between them.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <span class="feature-icon">🧩</span>
            <h3>Custom software</h3>
            <p>Internal tools, dashboards, bots, and web apps built around how your business actually works.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <span class="feature-icon">☁️</span>
            <h3>Websites &amp; hosting</h3>
            <p>Fast, secure websites — built, hosted, monitored, and maintained.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:24px">
        <a href="/Packages" class="section-link">See packages &amp; pricing &rarr;</a>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="landing-mid-cta">
    <p>Tell me what's broken. You'll get a plan, not a sales pitch.</p>
    <a href="/Contact" class="btn-large btn-signup">Get in touch</a>
</section>

<section class="landing-how-it-works">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">No jargon, no runaround, no surprise invoices.</p>
    <div class="steps-grid">
        <div class="step-card">
            <div class="step-num">1</div>
            <h3>Reach out</h3>
            <p>Describe the problem in plain English — a form and one business day is all it takes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
            <div class="step-num">2</div>
            <h3>Get a plan</h3>
            <p>An honest assessment, a clear quote, and what happens if you do nothing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
            <div class="step-num">3</div>
            <h3>Get it fixed</h3>
            <p>The work gets done — and you're told what was done and why.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="landing-depth">
    <h2>Proof, not promises.</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Everything below was designed, built, and is operated in production by Torvex.</p>
    <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
            <span class="feature-icon">💬</span>
            <h3>A live communication platform</h3>
            <p>Torvex Community — real-time chat, voice, and an in-chat game, running in production right here.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <span class="feature-icon">🛡️</span>
            <h3>Security tooling</h3>
            <p>AltGuard — an anti-abuse and verification suite protecting online communities every day.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <span class="feature-icon">🤖</span>
            <h3>Bots &amp; automation</h3>
            <p>Moderation tooling, integrations, and bots serving communities around the clock.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <span class="feature-icon">🖥️</span>
            <h3>Infrastructure</h3>
            <p>Servers, databases, deployments, and monitoring — self-hosted and self-managed.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:24px">
        <a href="/Community" class="section-link">Visit the Torvex Community &rarr;</a>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="landing-differentiator">
    <h2>Also home to the Torvex Community.</h2>
    <p>Torvex started as a chat platform built for friend groups — it's still here, still free, and still growing.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta" style="margin-top:20px">
        <a href="/Community" class="btn-large btn-login">Explore the Community</a>
    </div>
    <a href="https://discord.gg/scpwTFGVkz" class="hero-discord" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.317 4.3698a19.7913 19.7913 0 00-4.8851-1.5152.0741.0741 0 00-.0785.0371c-.211.3753-.4447.8648-.6083 1.2495-1.8447-.2762-3.68-.2762-5.4868 0-.1636-.3933-.4058-.8742-.6177-1.2495a.077.077 0 00-.0785-.037 19.7363 19.7363 0 00-4.8852 1.515.0699.0699 0 00-.0321.0277C.5334 9.0458-.319 13.5799.0992 18.0578a.0824.0824 0 00.0312.0561c2.0528 1.5076 4.0413 2.4228 5.9929 3.0294a.0777.0777 0 00.0842-.0276c.4616-.6304.8731-1.2952 1.226-1.9942a.076.076 0 00-.0416-.1057c-.6528-.2476-1.2743-.5495-1.8722-.8923a.077.077 0 01-.0076-.1277c.1258-.0943.2517-.1923.3718-.2914a.0743.0743 0 01.0776-.0105c3.9278 1.7933 8.18 1.7933 12.0614 0a.0739.0739 0 01.0785.0095c.1202.099.246.1981.3728.2924a.077.077 0 01-.0066.1276 12.2986 12.2986 0 01-1.873.8914.0766.0766 0 00-.0407.1067c.3604.698.7719 1.3628 1.225 1.9932a.076.076 0 00.0842.0286c1.961-.6067 3.9495-1.5219 6.0023-3.0294a.077.077 0 00.0313-.0552c.5004-5.177-.8382-9.6739-3.5485-13.6604a.061.061 0 00-.0312-.0286zM8.02 15.3312c-1.1825 0-2.1569-1.0857-2.1569-2.419 0-1.3332.9555-2.4189 2.157-2.4189 1.2108 0 2.1757 1.0952 2.1568 2.419 0 1.3332-.9555 2.4189-2.1569 2.4189zm7.9748 0c-1.1825 0-2.1569-1.0857-2.1569-2.419 0-1.3332.9554-2.4189 2.1569-2.4189 1.2108 0 2.1757 1.0952 2.1568 2.419 0 1.3332-.946 2.4189-2.1568 2.4189Z"/></svg>
        Join our Discord server
    </a>
</section>

<section class="landing-emotional">
    <p>You don't need a bigger IT department.<br /><strong>You need someone who picks up, fixes it, and explains it.</strong></p>
</section>

<section class="landing-final-cta">
    <h2>Have a technology problem?</h2>
    <a href="/Contact" class="btn-large btn-signup">Tell me about it</a>
    <p class="landing-final-cta-sub">No obligation. You'll hear back within one business day.</p>
</section>
